Z||000008||MooCow||08-23-2001||12:16 AM||||Ed Parks has done a 4.9 swap with the 4-speed auto from the caddy.  According to him you can squeel the tires in first and second very nicley.  He also says that the auto is going to be about just as fast as a stick would unless it was a pro driving in the stick.  He is making a kit for people to buy.  Also he has made it so you can use the stock exhaust system, and has all the wiring done.  As far as a price goes he is still unsure but he has told me that the auto is going to be around $1,300-1,600.  Also he says the car should do 0-60 in under 6 sec easily with the 4.9.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||1
